# Line endings.
#
# The repository stores LF. Without this file git decides per-checkout on
# Windows, so a file saved by one editor lands in the index with CRLF and every
# subsequent diff reports the whole file as rewritten. `text=auto` lets git
# detect text files; `eol=lf` fixes what it writes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalize, never diff.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary

